# wiki-curator-cog — the names this cog reads. Names only: the values live
# in Doppler (mini-app-polis-ecosystem / dev locally, prd for local runs
# against production) and, for the Lambda worker, in SSM. Run under
# `doppler run -- …`; do not copy this to .env — nothing reads it.
#
# Uncommented names are required in Doppler's dev config, and
# `uv run check-doppler-keys` checks dev holds every one. Commented names
# are optional: the code has a default, or only production reads them.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required: upstream API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# external tooling: read by miniapppolis-common-utils' KaianoApiClient.
# api-kaianolevine-com — internal API. Production reads
# KAIANO_API_BASE_URL; every other environment reads KAIANO_API_BASE_URL_DEV,
# with no fallback between them. This cog authenticates with its own named
# key (WIKI_CURATOR_COG_API_KEY); there is no fallback, so unset or wrong
# means 401 on every call. See ecosystem-standards CD-019.
KAIANO_API_BASE_URL_DEV=
# KAIANO_API_BASE_URL=
WIKI_CURATOR_COG_API_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The model
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The provider, anthropic (default) or openai, and its model (default per
# provider: claude-sonnet-4-6 / gpt-4.1-mini), as transcription-cog reads
# them.
# LLM_PROVIDER=
# LLM_MODEL=

# external tooling: read by miniapppolis-common-utils' build_llm. The
# provider's API key; a dry run needs neither. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is the
# default provider's.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Prices in USD per million tokens, input and output, for the cost each
# command's summary estimates. Both must be set to apply; unset, the price
# comes from the table in usage.py by model name.
# LLM_PRICE_INPUT_PER_MTOK=
# LLM_PRICE_OUTPUT_PER_MTOK=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local commands only: the wcs-wiki clone
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Path to your local wcs-wiki clone, for `render` and as the home of the
# .curator state cache (default ../wcs-wiki). Not in Doppler: set it in your
# shell, and `doppler run` passes it through.
# WIKI_REPO_PATH=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional: observability
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# external tooling: read by miniapppolis-common-utils' init_sentry, logger
# and environment module. LOGGING_LEVEL defaults to INFO; ENVIRONMENT is set
# by Doppler per config (development in dev, production in prd).
# SENTRY_DSN_COGS=
# LOGGING_LEVEL=
# ENVIRONMENT=
